===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈliːbanɔn/|lang=de}}

===Proper noun===
{{de-proper noun|m|g2=n|Libanons|gen2=Libanon}}

# [[Lebanon]]

====Usage notes====
* The word is sometimes used without a definite article as in English: ''Libanon, in Libanon''. In this case, the genitive is always ''Libanons'', for example ''Libanons Hauptstadt'' – "Lebanon's capital".
* More commonly, however, the definite article is used with the name: ''der Libanon, im Libanon''. In this case, the genitive usually is ''des Libanon'', although ''des Libanons'' is also correct: ''die Hauptstadt des Libanon(s)'' – "the capital of Lebanon".

